     max-width: 100%;
     height: auto;
     margin:
      2rem auto;
   }
   /*
   * -------------------------------------------------------
   * Image framing.
   *
   * Every content image gets wrapped (client-side, see the
   * script above) in a bordered "frame" — the same hairline
