   }
   /*
   * -------------------------------------------------------
   * Margin notes (sidenotes).
   *
   * Mobile-first: the note is collapsed by default and
   * expands inline, right where its reference number sits,
   * when the number is tapped/clicked or reached via keyboard
   * and toggled with Space. See the min-width query further
